						<div class="bdt-ep-accordion-content bdt-accordion-content">
							<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">CMR School Kompally offers education from Pre-Primary (Nursery, PP1, PP2) to Secondary (Grade VI – VIII).</span></p>						</div>
