							<span role="heading" class="bdt-ep-title-text bdt-flex-inline bdt-flex-middle" >

																What is the teaching methodology employed at CMR School Kompally?							</span>

						</div>
						<div class="bdt-ep-accordion-content bdt-accordion-content">
							<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We employ a student-centric approach focused on experiential learning, fostering creativity, critical thinking, and holistic development.</span></p>						</div>
					</div>
