						</div>
						<div class="bdt-ep-accordion-content bdt-accordion-content">
							<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Students have access to a wide range of extracurricular activities including sports, music, dance, arts, and more to explore their interests and talents.</span></p>						</div>
